From 62b476838024bf972debcc7de1d8340e81f3491a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Fangjian Ju <roger@FangjiandeMacBook-Pro.local>
Date: Mon, 31 Aug 2026 13:18:04 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 7/7] [rh2-integration] pin sglang-miles and Megatron commits
 in the Dockerfile
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

SGLANG_COMMIT was empty, so every build silently followed the moving
sglang-miles branch (FETCH_HEAD) while the base image stayed at the
SGLANG_IMAGE_TAG version — the exact mixed-environment drift the rh2
integration base exists to prevent. Freeze both moving refs:

- SGLANG_COMMIT=4e230c3d85cefdab5b65eeb6f6f87793a707a6fb
  (sglang-miles HEAD, 2026-08-31; verified to contain the per-request
  weight-version spans module python/sglang/srt/utils/weight_versions.py
  and to match the v0.5.18 image line the tree already uses)
- MEGATRON_COMMIT=235952df607b3820716e5e67728a5ab470ca33ae
  (radixark/Megatron-LM miles-main HEAD, 2026-08-31)

Dockerfile.rocm is intentionally left unpinned: the rh2 deployment
surface is the CUDA/sm_120 image only, and an unverifiable pin would
only look controlled.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 docker/Dockerfile | 12 +++++++++---
 1 file changed, 9 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/docker/Dockerfile b/docker/Dockerfile
index 067142ae4..80296afb9 100644
--- a/docker/Dockerfile
+++ b/docker/Dockerfile
@@ -17,12 +17,18 @@ FROM lmsysorg/sglang:${SGLANG_IMAGE_TAG} AS sglang
 # ======================================== Arguments =============================================
 
 ARG SGLANG_BRANCH=sglang-miles
-ARG SGLANG_COMMIT=""
+# [rh2-integration] Freeze the moving sglang-miles branch so builds are
+# reproducible. 4e230c3d8 = sglang-miles HEAD at 2026-08-31; it carries the
+# per-request weight-version spans (python/sglang/srt/utils/weight_versions.py)
+# that rh2 consumes, and matches the v0.5.18 image line above.
+ARG SGLANG_COMMIT="4e230c3d85cefdab5b65eeb6f6f87793a707a6fb"
 
 ARG MEGATRON_REPO=radixark/Megatron-LM
 ARG MEGATRON_BRANCH=miles-main
-# Empty means the branch HEAD at build time; release builds set it to freeze one commit.
-ARG MEGATRON_COMMIT=""
+# [rh2-integration] Freeze miles-main for reproducible builds
+# (235952df6 = branch HEAD at 2026-08-31; overriding to "" restores
+# branch-HEAD-at-build-time behavior).
+ARG MEGATRON_COMMIT="235952df607b3820716e5e67728a5ab470ca33ae"
 
 ARG ENABLE_CUDA_13=1
 
